-- [HIGH] intro: Unhedged absolute claim ('the only') about competitive market position that can change without notice and needs hedging even if currently accurate.
update programs set intro = replace(intro, 'Frontier is, as of mid-2026, the only national ULCC of size still operating', 'Frontier is, as of mid-2026, the only national ULCC of size still operating - though the competitive landscape can shift'), last_verified = current_date where slug = 'frontier' and intro like '%Frontier is, as of mid-2026, the only national ULCC of size still operating%';

